<%# Numbered steps in order, each a title and what it means: one ordered list, each step an item of its title, a heading of level 3, then its text with its line breaks. The number is no text of the page: site.css draws it before each item, a counter in a disc, and the ordered list gives a screen reader the order. The colour is the colour of the discs, kept as an accordion keeps the colour of its lines, so the titles and the texts keep the band's. An item that is not an object is left out. -%>
<%- style = block_style(block) -%>
<%- items = Array(block_props(block)["items"]).select { |item| item.is_a?(Hash) } -%>
<%= tag.div(**block_root(block, [ "w", "w-steps", "sw-steps", BlockStyle.classes(style, "color", family: "line"), BlockStyle.visibility_classes(style) ], data: BlockStyle.free_color_data(style, "color", family: "line"))) do %><%= tag.ol(safe_join(items.map { |item| tag.li(safe_join([ tag.h3(prop_text(item, "title")), tag.p(text_with_breaks(prop_text(item, "text"))) ])) })) %><% end %>
